    "<h4><strong>Method 3: Mann-Whitney U Test Comparing Technical Indicators by Future Return Class</strong></h4>\n",
    "\n",
    "For this method, we test whether technical indicators have different distributions between stocks that later exceed a 3% future 20-day return and stocks that do not. If some indicators show meaningful differences, they may be useful features for the classification model later in the project.\n",
