    "MACD, MACD_Signal, and Daily_Return were not statistically significant, so there is not enough evidence from this test alone to say their distributions differ between the two target classes.\n",
    "\n",
    "This connects to the machine learning model because the test helps identify which technical indicators may be useful inputs for classification. However, statistical significance does not guarantee prediction accuracy, so the next step is to evaluate these features together using machine learning models."
   ]
